          {
            "m_dialogTag": "Completion",
            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "So if we recover the Lodestar and restore the Beacon of Hope, not only will the Shadow Wall fall, the spirits of the Alphoi will rise.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Alphoi_King_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Khan_EMP_97.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1397572,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC16_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Problem is I don't know the location of the Transmutator. High Luminary, do you know something? You clearly understood Bat better than me.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Alphoi_Bat_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Greysin_EMP_03.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1254378,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC14_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "I don't know anything about negativity. But it's a safe bet any important device is in Bat's enclave.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Alphoi_CasterF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ZigiStardust_EMP_30.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1254375,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC14_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Your robot friend in the Sewers seemed to know a lot. Maybe they can point you to the Transmutator.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Alphoi_CasterF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ZigiStardust_EMP_31.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1254375,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC02_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Yes, Ruumba! Wizard, I would accompany you on this mission, but you'd benefit from someone with greater technical skills than I.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Pig_Captain_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Pork_EMP_125.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1254352,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC06_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Logically, Captain, would you not be better suited for such a task? Plus, you already know the environment...",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Nimbari_Crewman_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Sparck_EMP_49.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1254357,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC02_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Mr. Sparck, don't be so closeminded. Besides, I must stay here and help train the Light Brigade in my Pork-Chop!",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Pig_Captain_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Pork_EMP_126.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1254352,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC06_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
